    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ASSOMA is dedicated to minimizing environmental impact, both within our operations and for our customers. For more than 20 years, we have prioritized the design and development of products that are not only environmentally friendly but also energy efficient. This long-term commitment is at the core of our business philosophy and product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
